<p>COMPANY		 ESTIMATE  ACTUAL  PCT SURPRISE</p>
<p>Speedfam		0.37     0.46     24.32%</p>
<p>First Team	    0.29     0.32     10.34%</p>
<p>ADE		     0.38     0.41	7.89%</p>
